{
 "_doc": [
  "HITBOXES (scripts/combat/hitbox.gd, hurtboxes.gd). Distances in metres at body size 1.0 (scaled with the animal's genome size).",
  "hurtbox: the auto-fit of the hurt capsules from the skinned mesh. min_share: a bone with fewer of the sampled vertices hands them to its parent;",
  "  end_pct: trimmed ends of each capsule along its axis; radius_pct: the radius covers this share of its vertices; radius_scale: all capsules.",
  "  species.<id>.hurtbox / survivor.hurtbox override these, and bones.<bone>.radius_scale one capsule.",
  "creature_defaults.lead_frac: a move's window opens this share of the clip before its hit frame (anim_events.json hit_frac / hit_fracs) and closes at it.",
  "species.<id>.parts: the attacking parts of any move the species does not list; moves.<move>: {clip (default the move), window [from, to] (clip fractions),",
  "  lead_frac, parts}. A part: bone, radius (default: the animal's own hurtbox radius at that bone, x radius_scale), length + axis (a capsule",
  "  from the bone along axis in the bone frame: horns, a blade), offset [x,y,z] in the bone frame.",
  "Moves: attack_primary, attack_heavy, bite_combo (one window per bite), tail_swipe, kick, pounce (TacticalBrain leap), charge (the run-in ram; a loop: window [0,1]).",
  "survivor.moves: swing (attack_primary clip; weapons.<tool_class or damage_type> adds the blade), heavy (attack_heavy), punch, kick, tackle. Dodge-roll has none. armed: the move takes the weapon's parts.",
  "calibrated: true marks a radius widened (tests/t_hitboxes.gd calibration) so the part reaches a survivor standing in front (behind, for kick and tail_swipe) at the brain's contact reach: the clip itself stops short or passes overhead. Shrink it when the clip or the AI spacing is fixed."
 ],
